    "thought2": "The rise of advanced AI may challenge human identity as we know it, forcing us to reconsider the meaning of work, the role of human caregivers, and the notion of self and individuality. In this new paradigm, humans might continue to experience various emotions, thoughts, and qualia because of the evolutionary history shaped by having a material body and a central nervous system, despite having AI capabilities. On the other hand, while AIs may also experience some form of qualia, these could systemically differ from ones experienced by humans.",
